Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards\Nthe horizon We will find
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Infinity for sure. Let's\Nfight for this blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,sea and let the wind Take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,us far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,up So I can come back\Nto this moment So I can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,be present right here Throw away this drop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something you share. Shut\Nit up. Do not be so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to podcast To have a\Nfriend right here And I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,will always be here by\Nyour side To take care of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You. Even in the darkest\Nof times, I'll try. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And breathe it out. It's\Nalright now. Cause we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,are the ones who are\Nmeant to move in love We
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will move to our single\Nhorizon. We will find
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Insanity for sure. We're\Na world for our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We will win for sure\NDreaming on We will move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,towards the horizon We\Nwill fight however we can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to be the best\Nwe will run To the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to the end We gotta be the\Nones that just keep dreaming on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't give up now\NI can never stop cause
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give everything I got to\NBecome the greatest of all times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon\NWe will find infinite fortunes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will step up and we will leave\Nfor sure. So keep moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All in. This is bad. She's\Ndangerous even without her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this towery old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to keep your\Ndistance from her old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That old lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...is an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna get up, lizard boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me, you hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My red bean soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It will not be enough for my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fuck it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Udon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The present is falling apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they made it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with us, Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's completely unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But his bounty is 1.3 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she knock him\Nout in just two heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think that's my Oshiriko I smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked she took\Ndown a Titan like Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Her power must be on a whole other level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's big mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Report to Commander\NKaido immediately! Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The never-opening cell got broken apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, it's probably dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chained up for years, then\Ncrushed to death. Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. I'll report to\NOnigashima right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:07:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The aroma of that sweet soup is dancing\Nthrough the air. What's the plan, Warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We need some orders here. Can we shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to make her angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Any word from the commander yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got bad news, Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,None of her snails are able to\Nestablish a connection anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we can't\Ncontact Onigashima, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that the enemy is\Ndistracted by the turmoil out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That Caribou sure is a useful fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen here, we'll cut\Noff their communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they can't relay any more messages,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll be running around like\Nchickens with their heads cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, with the way the smells\Nwork here, it'll be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't know, the\NWano smells have a huge weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Their signal strength is pitifully weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So they use a unique system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of sending their\Ncommunication straight to each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the snails bounce off a boss snail first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one of these guys in each region.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it gets a message,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it sends it to other regions that\Nwould normally be out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I never really pondered it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's cause you're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the plan stars me in my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen if I\Ngobble up Udon's boss snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolute chaos is what\NI see now that way they.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be able to relay\Nmessages correct ding
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,ding we have a winner\Nfortunately for you i've
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,been making good use of\Nmy time in this prison
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,i know all sorts of things including\Nwhere that big snail is located
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it will, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just sit back, relax,\Nand let me work my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, why don't you go\Nand gather up all the keys, Raizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.70,0:09:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now, Kawamatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll set you\Nfree, no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This smell, there's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I found my dear suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a rich and sweet sandpilling year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe there's so much of it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was worth coming all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,WARDEN! SIR!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I HAVE REALLY BAD NEWS!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT IS IT? I'M BUSY!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.14,0:09:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's about to find out that the\Npot has nothing inside of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,UGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:09:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,IT WAS EMPTY ALL ALONG!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,PIG BOMB IS NOTORIOUS\NFOR HER LOVE OF FOOD!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT'S GOING TO HAPPEN WHEN\NSHE FINDS OUT THERE'S NO SOUP?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,NO ONE WILL BE SAFE FROM\NHER UNSTOPPABLE RAGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,SHE 'LL KILL US ALL WHERE WE STAND!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about to become a disaster zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's every man for himself! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Like your lives depend on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell could have\Neaten the entire pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom seems really\Nbummed out, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really blame her, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I would kill for another\Ncouple bowls myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That soup sure was tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What, why's everybody\Nlooking at me all weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you even hear yourself just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You just admitted that you ate the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was pretty yummy though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you made me say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the harm has already been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Tato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally find Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.82,0:11:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's made himself\Nthe center of trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did I hear you correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the man who ate\Nall the red bean soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That sweet scent is all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If we leave the ring, our heads pop off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance to\Nwork this out, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep hearing that stupid name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That person is not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a rotten soup\Nstealer. What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, she probably doesn't realize it's\Nme because of my samurai disguise, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is anything like her\Nlast food fit, it won't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad, like really, really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beeping at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If she pushes us back\Nany further, we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot back down even a single step!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so big I could have shared it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That poor little town!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank them for being nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Oshiroku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try it, Olin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to repay them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They had so little, but they\Ngave me a stranger so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to bring them some\Nof that yummy red bean soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You took the joy away\Nfrom those poor people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.52,0:14:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.94,0:14:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't hunger pangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's literally going to\Nkill us all with kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't leave a drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm flinching!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They took him off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The colors are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See that, old man? I got\Nhim! They're off! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's run, old\Nman! Wait, Mr. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more thing. Hold that\Nfeeling. Protect me from Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,stop talking crazy let's go the\Nmidst of danger is when true
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,power blooms get back here sure\Nyou want me to train right now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,if i mess this up then you're\Nprobably gonna die i am quite aware
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,that's it you're done
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,come on i won't budge i can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,do this just have to do\Nwhat rayleigh did back then
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm going to remove your collar\Nnow are you ready young lady
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now hold on, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't, it'll explode Yeah, it's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we've seen it happen before\NStop, you'll hurt her Bad idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,very bad idea Stop him, please
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be alright. Just don't flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, just\Nwait, this is a big mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's set it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do? You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,KB!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to do it, but\NI still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I manage to pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I did it without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember\Nwhat I did differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, you're not getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, that was an incredible\NRyu-O technique you exhibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite truthfully, it's far\Nsuperior to what I can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you have the\Npotential to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Deflect that woman's\Npreposterously powerful fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:19:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you can save our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and prove me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried you'll die, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that he's trying\Nto catch your fist, can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy. He'll deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta loosen up, right? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My Haki floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Tato, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:19:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you think that would go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I screwed it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I used for you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So she'll just both just in case. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive after all of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, I have one\Nfinal thing to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about the application of **Haki**.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:21:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Haki as you call\Nit coats your outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be used as armor\Nand also as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,However, when you push that\Npower beyond its limits,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,your Haki doesn't simply\Nfortify your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Within a focus, it can penetrate\Nthe enemy's body itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,effectively destroying\Nthem from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have already harnessed\Nthis ability once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Those steel collars were\Ndestroyed from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the power of your Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've proven that you have the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Potential within you. Oh man! The power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been working so hard to master\Nhas been inside of you all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You just didn't realize it was there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in that power and use it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.22,0:22:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some nerve eating that\Nentire pot of red bean soup
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.72,0:23:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Mr. Srahach!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.72,0:23:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no connection, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.79,0:23:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the boss snail\Nvanished into thin air!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that rumbling?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.42,0:24:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.33,0:24:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pitfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.46,0:24:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, that blast must have\Nbeen the furnace in the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironworks exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.02,0:24:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take her on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.82,0:24:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.10,0:24:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.01,0:24:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no chance against\Na monster like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She managed to completely\Ndestroy Master Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.60,0:24:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you're OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That old bat's acting\Nlike she owns this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm going to show her what happens\Nwhen you move in on Kaido's turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.10,0:25:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But we only get one shot, so listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.12,0:25:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only delaying the inevitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Big Mom is running\Naround like a wild boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.58,0:25:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna charge straight through Udon\Nand loop back around to us. You follow?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.24,0:25:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Set a trap right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.18,0:26:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.42,0:26:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, everything has been set in place!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.80,0:26:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes right now, Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:26:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, she just won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.26,0:27:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my red bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.14,0:27:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There was more after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.38,0:27:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.48,0:27:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.38,0:27:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.06,0:27:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked me! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.90,0:27:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.12,0:27:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,RAPTOR!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.36,0:27:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.27,0:27:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,FUNNY!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lighten the dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.18,0:28:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.78,0:28:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You really showed her who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.00,0:28:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody messes with Master Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.22,0:28:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He just saved the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.04,0:28:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.10,0:28:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are my sweet darling babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.18,0:28:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, my head is throbbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what was I doing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.64,0:28:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We were on our way to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.94,0:28:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell into the sea and was\Nseparated from my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.86,0:28:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It was right after that\Ndamn king interfered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.94,0:28:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I recall washing up on the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.34,0:28:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a dingy little town I visited,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.74,0:29:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and they served me food.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.90,0:29:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshiruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.28,0:29:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou don't teach her to\Nscrew with a lead reformer!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you were a world-class\Npain in my ass back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.52,0:29:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.98,0:29:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now eat dirt, witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.70,0:29:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.61,0:29:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Moshiro go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.70,0:29:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better get out of here\Nwhile we still can, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.72,0:29:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't quite understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.46,0:29:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! I'll shoot up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That should have knocked her out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.64,0:29:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.38,0:29:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of Kaido's minions, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.64,0:29:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.46,0:29:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.70,0:29:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not sticking around to\Nfind out what she can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.98,0:29:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one more chance to answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.16,0:30:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.14,0:30:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oshinu call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand that over, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.56,0:30:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.62,0:30:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.98,0:30:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.80,0:30:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.18,0:30:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Get out the 100%\NSea Prism Stone cuffs and chains we need!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.98,0:30:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to lock her up now
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.04,0:31:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,she's
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.92,0:31:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.83,0:31:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,sir more
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.75,0:31:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,more you think that's\Nenough to hold her we
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.38,0:31:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be safe until you double those chains\Nbring me all the animal sedatives you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.32,0:31:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,can scrounge up and pronto our lives are
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.40,0:31:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,on the you morons you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.72,0:31:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,look alive is my ship
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.52,0:31:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ready absolutely sir prepare to evacuate\Nand leave only the bare minimum of staff
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.80,0:31:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody else get on board right away\Nbabanuki I'm leaving all of Udon under your
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.90,0:31:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,control you hear me oh yes sir that old bat\Ncompletely demolished every damn door in
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.22,0:31:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,this place so listen as soon as I'm gone\Nuse the emergency gates to put Udon in line
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.18,0:31:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw all the prisoners into their cells\Nand get these grounds back in order!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.12,0:31:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, but I am\Nconcerned about one thing, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.14,0:31:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.78,0:32:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Haul ass and don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.04,0:32:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking the old hack straight\Nto Commander Kaito's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.12,0:32:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.04,0:32:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.66,0:32:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.42,0:32:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo! Hey look!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.10,0:32:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate's closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we could help, but we promised\Nthem we would await their return here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have faith in\Nthem and stand our ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.78,0:32:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We on complete Loguetown yet? Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And is our connection restored?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't have communications, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it seems that\NUDOT is completely isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.04,0:32:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no way to exchange\Nmessages with the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.08,0:32:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.36,0:32:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.30,0:32:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.02,0:33:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad Big Mom and Balloon left or\NI could have used him to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.28,0:33:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This you guys will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.70,0:33:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.92,0:33:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That little pain in the ass is still free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.42,0:33:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey dummy, I've always been\Nfree. You're just like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.98,0:33:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,prisoner here don't be so cocky\Nsorry buddy this prison's mine now
